  triage:title "docs/project-plan.md section 55 header still reads '[IN PROGRESS]' on the phase's own closeout PR" ;
  triage:description "req-qa (qa-pr1199-r1 phase-end review), independently confirmed by quality-mgr via direct read: docs/project-plan.md:1563 reads '## 55. Phase AW -- Unified Retained Runtime Logging [IN PROGRESS]' while the sprint table immediately below it (lines 1573-1577) marks all five sprints AW.1-AW.5 as `complete`, and this PR (#1199, integrate/phase-aw -> develop) is itself the phase's closeout PR. Docs-only inconsistency, no functional impact, but misleading for anyone reading the plan doc post-merge. Fix: change the section-55 header bracket tag to [COMPLETE -- INTEGRATION PR #1199] (matching the convention used for phase 54's header at project-plan.md) as part of the docs closeout commit." ;
